  "locales": {
    "en": {
      "trackName": "Shadow Snakes: Snake Journey",
      "description": "A relaxing snake adventure with a challenge to master. Tap to change lanes, collect glowing sundrops, and dodge obstacles. Explore 14 worlds and 54 handcrafted levels on iPhone, iPad, and Apple Watch. Play offline with no ads or in-app purchases.\n\nCHOOSE YOUR WORLD\nSwipe through illustrated world cards, see which courses you’ve cleared, and start your next course. Revisit your favorite worlds and improve your best sundrop counts.\n\nFIREFLY MARSH AND AURORA PEAKS\nFollow fireflies toward optional sundrops in Firefly Marsh. In Aurora Peaks, read the shape of each gate to find the open lane. Each world has four new two-lane courses. Both worlds are available after the tutorial, and four clears in either world earn its permanent glow. Perfect collection is optional.\n\nTHE CAMPAIGN, MOONLIT TRAILS, AND DAILY REMIX\nPlay 40 campaign chapters and six permanent Moonlit Trails. Try a fresh Daily Remix and keep your Daily Glow alive. On iPhone and iPad, clear Daily Remixes on three different days within a rolling week to earn Weekly Glow. No consecutive streak is required for that reward.\n\nSIMPLE CONTROLS. SATISFYING CHALLENGE.\nStart with two lanes, then discover three-lane campaign chapters on iPhone and iPad. Follow sundrop routes and build Flow chains. After three failed campaign attempts on iPhone and iPad, you can choose Gentle Current for a slightly slower, unranked run.\n\nPLAY ON IPHONE, IPAD, AND APPLE WATCH\nEnjoy a full game on Apple Watch, plus a Daily Glow complication. Use optional iCloud sync to bring your progress across devices and optional Game Center features to track scores and achievements. Core gameplay works offline.\n\nCollect the light and find your next trail.",
      "releaseNotes": "Fixed an issue that could open the chapter list while swiping through worlds. Swipe left or right to keep browsing, and tap Courses when you want to see the chapter list.",
      "trackViewUrl": "https://apps.apple.com/us/app/shadow-snakes-snake-journey/id6763423585?uo=4",
      "formattedPrice": "Free",
      "sellerName": "Kemph Ventures, LLC",
      "genres": [
