      "version": "3.6",
      "releaseNotes": "Version 3.6 gives every chapter a distinct layout and rhythm, with a smoother difficulty curve from a forgiving opening to the fastest finale. It also adds richer procedural audio, more natural hazards, improved photographic worlds, and independent Apple Watch play with Game Center support.",
