    },
    {
      "version": "5.0.0",
      "releaseNotes": "Version 5 introduces a new three-lane challenge beginning in Chapter 12. Tap above or below the snake to move one lane at a time, build Flow chains, earn near-miss bonuses, and move through chapters with fewer interruptions. New players now begin by playing immediately, retries are faster, and rank rules are consistent across iPhone and iPad.",
      "seenAt": "2026-09-05T02:05:46Z"
    },
    {
      "version": "5.1.0",
      "releaseNotes": "Find your Flow in Shadow Snakes!\n\n• Follow new three-lane sundrop routes in Chapters 13–20, build Flow chains, and see your best Flow after each clear.\n• Stuck on a chapter? Choose Gentle Current after three attempts for a slightly slower, unranked run with the same campaign stars.\n• Clear Daily Remixes on three days in a week to earn a glowing trail. No consecutive streak required.\n• Unlock eight new Game Center achievements for exploration, Flow, close calls, and Daily Remix mastery.\n• Enjoy buffered lane taps, clearer feedback, and earlier obstacle warnings after repeated attempts.\n\nNew Flow & Glow features are available on iPhone and iPad.",
      "seenAt": "2026-10-01T04:03:27Z"
    },
    {
      "version": "5.2.0",
      "releaseNotes": "Follow the moonlight in Shadow Snakes!\n\n• Explore six new Moonlit Trails on iPhone, iPad, and Apple Watch. Every course is open from the start.\n• Clear all six to earn a permanent pale-blue snake glow. Perfect runs are optional.\n• Replay your favorite trails and improve your sundrop collection.\n• Find the new adventure directly on the journey map or Watch menu, with an optional controls refresher.\n• Keep your existing 40-chapter campaign progress and Daily Remix journey.\n• Enjoy a clearer Moonlit gameplay HUD on smaller Apple Watch displays.\n\nMoonlit Trails are here to stay. No ads or in-app purchases.",
      "seenAt": "2026-10-10T09:59:11Z"
    },
    {
      "version": "5.3.0",
      "releaseNotes": "Choose your next world in Shadow Snakes.\n\n• Swipe through 14 worlds and see your course progress from the new main menu.\n• Explore four Firefly Marsh courses. Follow glowing cues to find optional sundrop routes.\n• Explore four Aurora Peaks courses. Look for a clear gap to slip through the ice gates.\n• Earn a permanent glow by clearing all four courses in either new world.\n• Play the new courses on iPhone, iPad, and Apple Watch. The campaign, Moonlit Trails, and Daily Remix are still available.\n\nNo ads or in-app purchases.",
      "seenAt": "2026-11-19T22:37:28Z"
    },
    {
      "version": "5.3.1",
      "releaseNotes": "Fixed an issue that could open the chapter list while swiping through worlds. Swipe left or right to keep browsing, and tap Courses when you want to see the chapter list.",
      "seenAt": "2026-11-21T13:40:02Z"
    }
